{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:PredictedSpectra.HadronHalfLife","@type":"LeanModule","name":"PredictedSpectra.HadronHalfLife","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Pow.Real","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Log.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Trigonometric.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.Calculus.Deriv.Add","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.Calculus.Deriv.Inv","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.Calculus.Deriv.Pow"],"declarations":44,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.qSensitivity_near_48","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.qSensitivity_near_48","kind":"theorem","line":280,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L280-L284","doc":"The quoted `≈ 48`: at `q = 1.1097` the sensitivity lies in `(48, 49)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.qSensitivity_eq_logDeriv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.qSensitivity_eq_logDeriv","kind":"theorem","line":265,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L265-L278","doc":"**The manuscript's sensitivity formula is the logarithmic derivative of the\n`q`-shape**: `∂ln Γ/∂ln q = q · Γ'/Γ` with `Γ = qPrefactor`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.hasDerivAt_qPrefactor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.hasDerivAt_qPrefactor","kind":"theorem","line":242,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L242-L263","doc":"The derivative of the `q`-shape `(q + q⁻¹)(q − q⁻¹)^5`, for `q ≠ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.hadron_half_life_eq_halfLife","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.hadron_half_life_eq_halfLife","kind":"theorem","line":234,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L234-L240","doc":"Under that collapse the two half-lives agree. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.betaRate_eq_qPrefactor_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.betaRate_eq_qPrefactor_iff","kind":"theorem","line":216,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L216-L232","doc":"**What the legacy carrier was.** `Γ_β = qPrefactor q` exactly when the four\nnon-`q`-integer factors collapse onto the Sargent shape:\n`|𝒲|² μ₀/(2π³) · |ℳ_q|² · f(Q) = (q − q⁻¹)^5`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.hadron_half_life_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.hadron_half_life_pos","kind":"theorem","line":210,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L210-L214","doc":"The half-life is positive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.hadron_half_life","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.hadron_half_life","kind":"def","line":204,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L204-L208","doc":"**`prop:hadron-half-life`**: `t_{1/2} = ln 2 / Γ_β`. (Until 2026-09-04 this\nname was an alias for `BetaDecayData.halfLife`, the `q`-shape alone.) ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:hadron-half-life","label":"prop:hadron-half-life","md":"quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.betaRate_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.betaRate_pos","kind":"theorem","line":196,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L196-L202","doc":"The rate is positive: every factor is. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.betaRate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.betaRate","kind":"def","line":191,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L191-L194","doc":"`Γ_β = |𝒲(q)|² μ₀ /(2π³) · [2]_q · |ℳ_q|² · f(Q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaRateData.fQ_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaRateData.fQ_pos","kind":"theorem","line":189,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L189-L189","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaRateData.fQ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaRateData.fQ","kind":"def","line":188,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L188-L188","doc":"`f(Q)`, the Sargent phase-space integral. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaRateData.M2_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaRateData.M2_pos","kind":"theorem","line":186,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L186-L186","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaRateData.M2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaRateData.M2","kind":"def","line":185,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L185-L185","doc":"`|ℳ_q|²`, the parent/daughter Markov-trace ratio. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaRateData.mu0_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaRateData.mu0_pos","kind":"theorem","line":183,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L183-L183","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaRateData.mu0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaRateData.mu0","kind":"def","line":182,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L182-L182","doc":"`μ₀`, the dimensional scale (a unit choice). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaRateData.W2_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaRateData.W2_pos","kind":"theorem","line":180,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L180-L180","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaRateData.W2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaRateData.W2","kind":"def","line":179,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L179-L179","doc":"`|𝒲(q)|²`, the `T_{3,5}` weak-vertex form factor squared. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaRateData.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaRateData.mk","kind":"ctor","line":177,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L177-L177","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaRateData","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaRateData","kind":"structure","line":169,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L169-L189","doc":"The four factors of `Γ_β` beyond the `q`-integer, as data, each with the\npositivity the manuscript asserts of it (items 1, 3, 4, 5 of\n`prf:hadron-half-life`). They are data because none of them has a closed\nform in the corpus yet: `|𝒲(q)|²` is `|tr_M((σ₁σ₂)⁵)|²` in `H₃(q)`\n(`def:beta-decay-skein` carries only its 10-crossing budget), `|ℳ_q|²` is\n`s² · ∏ |V̂ᵢ^par / V̂ᵢ^dau|²` (`prop:trace-ratio-observable`), `f(Q)` is the\nSargent integral `∝ Q⁵`, and `μ₀` is the unit choice. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.mass_splitting","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.mass_splitting","kind":"theorem","line":159,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L159-L165","doc":"Mass splitting: m_n - m_p = S_dd - S_uu. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.neutronMass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.neutronMass","kind":"def","line":154,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L154-L157","doc":"Neutron mass from pair Skein weights: m_n = 2 S_ud + S_dd. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.protonMass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.protonMass","kind":"def","line":149,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L149-L152","doc":"Proton mass from pair Skein weights: m_p = S_uu + 2 S_ud. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.qSensitivity_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.qSensitivity_pos","kind":"theorem","line":141,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L141-L147","doc":"The sensitivity is positive for q > 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.qSensitivity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.qSensitivity","kind":"def","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L134-L139","doc":"Sensitivity: ∂ ln Γ / ∂ ln q = (q² - 1)/(q² + 1) + 5(q² + 1)/(q² - 1).\n\nAt q = 1.1097 this evaluates to ≈ 48. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.halfLife_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.halfLife_pos","kind":"theorem","line":128,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L128-L132","doc":"The half-life is positive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.halfLife","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.halfLife","kind":"def","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L118-L126","doc":"The `q`-SHAPE of the half-life: `ln 2 / qPrefactor q`.\n\nThis is NOT the proposition's `t_{1/2} = ln 2 / Γ_β` — it is that formula\nwith `|𝒲|² μ₀/(2π³) · |ℳ_q|² · f(Q)` collapsed onto `(q − q⁻¹)^5`\n(`betaRate_eq_qPrefactor_iff`). The full statement is `hadron_half_life`\nbelow. Kept because `qSensitivity` is its logarithmic derivative. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.qPrefactor_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.qPrefactor_pos","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L107-L116","doc":"The q-prefactor is positive for q > 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.qPrefactor_classical","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.qPrefactor_classical","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L101-L105","doc":"The q-prefactor vanishes at q = 1 (classical limit). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.qPrefactor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.qPrefactor","kind":"def","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L92-L99","doc":"The q-dependent prefactor of the decay rate:\nF(q) = (q + q⁻¹) · (q - q⁻¹)⁵.\n\nThis vanishes at q = 1 (no beta decay in classical limit)\nand is positive for q > 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.q_integer_2_gt_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.q_integer_2_gt_two","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L83-L90","doc":"[2]_q > 2 when q > 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.q_integer_2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.q_integer_2","kind":"def","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L77-L81","doc":"The q-integer [2]_q = q + q⁻¹, categorical dimension of the\nSU_q(2) fundamental representation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.pairSkeinMass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.pairSkeinMass","kind":"def","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L72-L75","doc":"Pair Skein mass: S_ab(q) = (q μ_a + q⁻¹ μ_b) / (q^½ + q^{-½}). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.mu_d_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.mu_d_pos","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L70-L70","doc":"mu_d is positive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.mu_d","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.mu_d","kind":"def","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L68-L68","doc":"Dressed down-quark Skein mass μ_d > 0. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.mu_u_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.mu_u_pos","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L66-L66","doc":"mu_u is positive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.mu_u","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.mu_u","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L64-L64","doc":"Dressed up-quark Skein mass μ_u > 0. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.delta_p_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.delta_p_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L62-L62","doc":"The nucleus is unstable: δp ≠ 0. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.delta_p","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.delta_p","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L60-L60","doc":"Proton displacement δp = p - p_stab(A), integer-valued. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.A_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.A_pos","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L58-L58","doc":"A ≥ 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.A","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L56-L56","doc":"Mass number A. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.q_gt_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.q_gt_one","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L54-L54","doc":"q > 1 (non-classical universe). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.q","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L52-L52","doc":"Substrate parameter q. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData.mk","kind":"ctor","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L50-L50","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayData","kind":"structure","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/hadron-half-life.lean#L47-L70","doc":"Data for a beta-decay calculation in a Descartes universe.\nAll quantities derived from q — no fitted parameters. ","signatureChunk":0}]}